  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POTHOLES PLUS PROGRAM 5</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds for this award will permanently secure 2,940 acres through 1,840 acres of conservation easements, and 1,100 acres of conservation agreement. Funds under this award will also be used to enhance 93 acres, and manage 121,920 acres of previously secured habitat. The purpose of this award if therefore to secure, enhance, and manage habitat for the benefit of migratory birds and other wildlife on southwestern Manitoba, with limited match activities occurring in Saskatchewan and Alberta</narrative>
  </description>
